  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIBE 2025 - New Vanilla ApS - Climate resilient vanilla farms and processing facility in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will conduct a feasibility study to identify suitable locations for new vanilla farms in Tanzania and assess the requirements for a central processing facility. The study will include land suitability analysis, market research, stakeholder workshops, and identification of processing methods for vanilla curing, powder, &quot;caviar&quot; and extract production. 

The goal is to establish a climate change-stable, scalable, and sustainable vanilla production model that supports local farmers, ensures high-quality output, and strengthens Tanzania&apos;s position in the global vanilla market.</narrative>
  </description>
